coffee in 5 hours, right?

542
00:36:48,900 --> 00:36:50,694
Excuse me.

543
00:36:50,937 --> 00:36:52,188
Three cups.

544
00:36:52,884 --> 00:36:55,219
I can only handle two.
I still love my life, okay.

545
00:37:02,114 --> 00:37:02,990
Glad to know.

546
00:37:03,240 --> 00:37:03,949
Know what?

547
00:37:05,473 --> 00:37:06,850
That you still love your life.

548
00:37:13,251 --> 00:37:14,501
Hey, wait!

549
00:37:16,191 --> 00:37:17,275
You took so long.

550
00:37:21,905 --> 00:37:22,822
Hey!

551
00:37:32,446 --> 00:37:34,251
<i>Do you feel better now?</i>

552
00:37:37,006 --> 00:37:39,126
<i>Weirdly... Yes.</i>

553
00:37:45,395 --> 00:37:47,355
<i>It's not weird to be happy.</i>

554
00:38:41,797 --> 00:38:43,633
I feel suffocated.

555
00:38:45,176 --> 00:38:46,677
It's like I can't breathe.

556
00:38:49,764 --> 00:38:51,265
And when I'm outside,

557
00:38:51,641 --> 00:38:52,975
I feel anxious.

558
00:38:53,768 --> 00:38:56,771
I'm afraid I might bump into him.

559
00:38:56,796 --> 00:39:00,022
I don't know where I can hide.

560
00:39:07,948 --> 00:39:08,577
Ke!

561
00:39:08,847 --> 00:39:09,848
Ke, Ke!

562
00:39:10,201 --> 00:39:11,243
Ke!

563
00:39:11,481 --> 00:39:12,334
Why?

564
00:39:13,143 --> 00:39:13,858
Ke.

565
00:39:14,405 --> 00:39:15,639
What’s wrong?

566
00:39:16,999 --> 00:39:19,210
- Ke…
- It's so unfair, Luna.

567
00:39:20,040 --> 00:39:21,792
He can have fun.

568
00:39:21,985 --> 00:39:24,988
He can party without a care in the world!

569
00:39:26,039 --> 00:39:27,553
It's infuriating,

570
00:39:28,010 --> 00:39:30,179
like he didn't do anything wrong.

571
00:39:30,859 --> 00:39:33,028
How about me?

572
00:39:34,525 --> 00:39:35,424
Ke…

573
00:39:35,449 --> 00:39:36,450
Ke.

574
00:39:36,475 --> 00:39:37,560
How?

575
00:39:38,158 --> 00:39:40,053
Why is it so easy for him?

576
00:39:44,188 --> 00:39:46,194
Doesn't he have a conscience?

577
00:39:48,948 --> 00:39:50,533
He doesn’t…

578
00:39:50,991 --> 00:39:52,492
I'm right here, okay?

579
00:39:57,206 --> 00:39:58,436
Don't cry anymore.

580
00:40:09,717 --> 00:40:10,515
Thank you, ma'am.

581
00:40:10,540 --> 00:40:11,667
Just wait at your table, please.

582
00:40:11,692 --> 00:40:12,484
Thank you.

583
00:40:13,723 --> 00:40:15,307
Ah, two—

584
00:40:15,846 --> 00:40:17,056
Iced Americano?

585
00:40:18,886 --> 00:40:20,346
Alex, I'll take care of this.

586
00:40:20,392 --> 00:40:22,144
- Yes.
- Just serve this to table two.

587
00:40:22,169 --> 00:40:23,754
- I got it from here.
- Okay.

588
00:40:28,904 --> 00:40:29,874
Rough night?

589
00:40:31,229 --> 00:40:32,170
Didn’t sleep much.

590
00:40:32,535 --> 00:40:36,330
Two lattes and two corned beef <i>pandesal.</i>

591
00:40:37,045 --> 00:40:40,048
So, no iced Americano today.

592
00:40:40,458 --> 00:40:42,209
I wanna try a different drink.

593
00:40:42,557 --> 00:40:46,019
You wanna try something different
but you're choosing latte?

594
00:40:46,896 --> 00:40:49,649
Now you're even meddling
with my drink choices.

595
00:40:51,877 --> 00:40:53,378
Let me make you a special drink,

596
00:40:54,685 --> 00:40:55,686
to switch things up.

597
00:40:57,850 --> 00:40:58,893
Fine.

598
00:40:58,893 --> 00:41:00,311
Surprise me then.

599
00:41:01,061 --> 00:41:02,480
Make sure it's good.

600
00:41:03,981 --> 00:41:05,107
Okay.

601
00:41:27,546 --> 00:41:29,028
Here’s your order, ma’am.

602
00:41:31,842 --> 00:41:34,762
That is called a Sakura drink.

603
00:41:36,180 --> 00:41:38,015
Iced strawberry latte made with love.

604
00:41:39,934 --> 00:41:42,192
I even added extra strawberries for you.

605
00:41:42,410 --> 00:41:44,954
It's your favorite, right?
I remember.

606
00:41:46,544 --> 00:41:47,966
Does it taste good, though?

607
00:41:48,716 --> 00:41:49,700
Try it.

608
00:41:57,910 --> 00:41:59,328
Why is it special?

609
00:42:00,788 --> 00:42:01,872
Because...

610
00:42:04,398 --> 00:42:05,858
I only made it for you.

611
00:42:06,708 --> 00:42:08,042
Give me a break.

612
00:42:12,882 --> 00:42:14,259
You really like it, huh?

613
00:42:15,233 --> 00:42:18,236
Well, you won't find that anywhere else.

614
00:42:19,234 --> 00:42:21,487
That's why you have no choice
but to come back here.

615
00:42:22,765 --> 00:42:23,891
You fell into my trap.

616
00:42:26,355 --> 00:42:27,356
Whatever.

617
00:43:40,598 --> 00:43:41,894
Yo, Neil. What's up?

618
00:43:42,125 --> 00:43:43,626
Bro, where are you?

619
00:43:44,433 --> 00:43:45,231
Why?

620
00:43:45,586 --> 00:43:48,662
Bro, don't tell me
you're ditching the party tonight.

621
00:43:48,687 --> 00:43:49,897
The whole gang's gonna be there.

622
00:43:50,714 --> 00:43:53,375
Sorry, bro.
I'm gonna have to pass today.

623
00:43:53,400 --> 00:43:56,036
Shan’s passing on a party?

624
00:43:57,172 --> 00:43:58,270
You serious?

625
00:44:01,728 --> 00:44:02,614
It’s nothing.

626
00:44:02,753 --> 00:44:04,723
I gotta go. Have fun.

627
00:44:04,838 --> 00:44:06,089
I'm driving right now.

628
00:44:06,114 --> 00:44:07,032
<i>I guess.</i>

629
00:44:07,057 --> 00:44:08,141
<i>See you, man.</i>

630
00:44:14,788 --> 00:44:15,580
Yeah.

631
00:44:16,775 --> 00:44:17,859
Just get some rest.

632
00:44:19,161 --> 00:44:20,802
Looks like you've been through a lot.

633
00:44:22,304 --> 00:44:24,223
Just take a good rest.

634
00:44:25,432 --> 00:44:26,600
I'll be right here.

635
00:44:43,200 --> 00:44:44,827
Good morning!

636
00:44:46,161 --> 00:44:46,912
Hello!

637
00:44:48,559 --> 00:44:50,629
Um... Hi?

638
00:44:51,625 --> 00:44:52,960
Are you new here?

639
00:44:54,545 --> 00:44:55,587
What are you doing?

640
00:44:56,088 --> 00:44:58,924
Oh, your sandcastle is so pretty!

641
00:44:59,278 --> 00:45:01,906
But why does your toy look broken?

642
00:45:02,928 --> 00:45:04,263
Are you from Bataan?

643
00:45:06,846 --> 00:45:08,181
I'm from here, too.

644
00:45:08,583 --> 00:45:10,286
This is where my dad's from.

645
00:45:10,756 --> 00:45:14,489
But we're just on vacation,
about 3 days now.

646
00:45:14,708 --> 00:45:16,950
What's your name? I'm Ayi.

647
00:45:17,304 --> 00:45:18,514
That's my nickname.

648
00:45:39,676 --> 00:45:42,804
Ayi! Let's go, time to eat.

649
00:45:43,075 --> 00:45:44,493
Okay, mommy.

650
00:45:44,875 --> 00:45:47,122
We have to go.
See you when I see you!

651
00:46:07,281 --> 00:46:08,574
See you yesterday.

652
00:46:09,745 --> 00:46:11,538
Yesterday’s already in the past.

653
00:46:11,538 --> 00:46:13,123
You should say, “See you soon”.

654
00:46:13,123 --> 00:46:13,916
Shan!

655
00:46:13,916 --> 00:46:15,167
You’ve thought about it?

656
00:46:16,335 --> 00:46:17,711
- Frat?
- Mhmm.

657
00:46:17,711 --> 00:46:19,922
There are a lot of perks
to being a fraternity brother.

658
00:46:23,360 --> 00:46:24,606
What’s your problem?

659
00:46:25,177 --> 00:46:26,553
Are you doing anything later?

660
00:46:27,971 --> 00:46:29,389
Do you want another escape?

661
00:46:29,654 --> 00:46:30,926
Where are we going?

662
00:46:38,757 --> 00:46:40,968
What?
Do you want more—

663
00:46:42,277 --> 00:46:43,237
Shan?

664
00:46:43,862 --> 00:46:45,656
I knew it, you fucker—

665
00:46:59,211 --> 00:47:00,629
Long time no see.

666
00:47:01,463 --> 00:47:02,381
You have a date?

667
00:47:03,674 --> 00:47:04,508
Uh—

668
00:47:06,218 --> 00:47:07,136
Um—
